## Positioning

The Basics suite is the body of everyday interfaces. Its seven groups unfold from atoms to full paths: **General** (buttons, icons, avatars, badges), **Form** (inputs, selects, dates, switches, uploads), **Layout** (containers, grids, cards), **Navigation** (tabs, breadcrumbs, menus), **Data Display** (tables, trees, timelines), **Feedback** (dialogs, drawers, progress) and **Status & Empty** (empty states, errors, skeletons). Everything imports on demand through the `@talex-touch/tuffex/base` entry.

